{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰析薪膏肓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺州張明刊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦是將別教一乘對法相宗三乘料揀，亦以三乘\n通於始終二教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此文不許昔大皆屬權也，亦是通中間三教之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此當臨門三車。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此不許於第二第三時一向是權。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則許昔三唯始教。此中許意非昔無實，但實體不足，由對法華一\n向實故。大分以昔三是權始教義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦許二三時為權始教義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是進入別教一乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上論文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺州張明刊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此上但是都無所曉，平白不是，只可笑而\n不可形容，故不能盡謬妄科目也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
